adership and innovation in open\nsource software development and open science. However, expertise and resources\nhave traditionally been distributed across various parts of the campus. The Open\nSource Programs Team at UCSB serves as a central hub, bringing together open\nsource activities, expertise, and community connections.","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"Ow9AqP1Wfs"}],"key":"J4JcOTdsSB"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"We’re here to answer any and all questions about open source at UCSB. We\nprovide all the services described on the\n","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"sq43NA3Ow3"},{"type":"link","url":"/about/services","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Network’s Services page","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"iukMcqJ5OC"}],"urlSource":"../about/services.md","dataUrl":"/about.services.json","internal":true,"protocol":"file","key":"nScDsmcOvv"},{"type":"text","value":", in collaboration with our\npartners across the Network. Send us an email at ","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"LmBFbskyWh"},{"type":"link","url":"ospo@library.ucsb.edu","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ospo@library​.ucsb​.edu","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"ERQYmXDrCY"}],"urlSource":"ospo@library.ucsb.edu","key":"wKUNU9kesF"},{"type":"text","value":" to\nintroduce yourself today.","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"fZKpBFDuCb"}],"key":"xBaS0McBnz"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"